  review and verdict layer), better-layout (and its sidecars)

The `impeccable-bridge` skill is an original BRIDGE file (no upstream content
vendored). It points to the standalone `impeccable` skill (Apache-2.0, based on
Anthropic's frontend-design skill), which is installed and licensed separately.

`web-design-engineer-bridge`, `tastemaker-bridge`, `mengto-skills-bridge`, and
`taste-skills-bridge` are original BRIDGE files as well (no upstream content
vendored). They point at ConardLi/garden-skills (web-design-engineer),
codeswithroh/tastemaker, MengTo/Skills, and Leonxlnx/taste-skill respectively -
all MIT, all installed and licensed separately in the target project.

